## Pricing and Access

Prey pricing is per device and scales by fleet size and organizational needs, covering individuals, SMBs, mid-market, enterprise, and MSPs.

Prey does not offer a free plan. All plans include a 14-day free trial, extendable to 30 days upon request. No credit card is required to start the trial.

Prey is significantly more affordable than traditional enterprise MDM platforms, making it accessible to budget-constrained organizations such as schools, nonprofits, and small businesses.

